WEBVTT

00:01.300 --> 00:04.880
Begging Your Majesty's pardon! 
Yet more letters have arrived!

00:04.880 --> 00:08.470
Zamanian envoys request an 
audience with Your Majesty!

00:08.470 --> 00:11.150
Goya and Sarbul have sent envoys, as well!

00:13.950 --> 00:16.610
All concerning the acting 
queen consort, sire.

00:16.890 --> 00:19.480
Turn them away. They waste my time.

00:19.480 --> 00:20.910
Are you certain that's wise?

00:21.410 --> 00:23.610
Nothing has even happened yet.

00:24.260 --> 00:28.370
Let them see the acting 
queen's work for themselves.

00:28.370 --> 00:31.310
If they still object to her, then so be it.

00:31.940 --> 00:35.390
I'll hear their grievances then.

00:35.650 --> 00:38.230
Instruct the envoys to 
tell their lords as much.

00:38.230 --> 00:38.950
Ye...

00:38.950 --> 00:39.840
Yes, sire.

00:40.680 --> 00:44.350
<i>I knew I wasn't imagining things.</i>

00:44.810 --> 00:49.790
<i>His Majesty has changed yet again 
since the Grand Consecration.</i>

02:19.990 --> 02:24.990
Divine Protection and the Acting Queen Consort

02:27.950 --> 02:30.420
<i>Another flood of envoys today.</i>

02:31.030 --> 02:34.980
<i>I'd expected backlash, 
but this is still staggering.</i>

02:34.980 --> 02:38.630
<i>Lady Sariphi must be feeling nervous.</i>

02:39.480 --> 02:41.130
<i>I simply must step in</i>

02:42.320 --> 02:45.910
<i>to lift her spirits!</i>

02:50.250 --> 02:51.360
Lady Sariphi—

02:51.680 --> 02:55.230
What's the matter, Amit? 
You look so serious.

02:56.070 --> 02:56.850
Goodness.

02:57.170 --> 03:00.480
Oh, well... Lady Sariphi, 
what are those garments?

03:00.840 --> 03:07.480
Mr. Chancellor said that my normal clothes 
were "too shabby for a queen's work."

03:07.710 --> 03:12.050
Y-You look l-lovely in your 
usual clothes, too, Sari!

03:12.050 --> 03:12.950
Lovely!

03:13.380 --> 03:14.650
Thank you.

03:15.330 --> 03:18.650
You're so composed, Lady Sariphi.

03:18.650 --> 03:22.290
The palace is in an uproar, 
and so is everywhere else.

03:22.990 --> 03:27.190
I know, and I can't pretend I'm not nervous.

03:27.550 --> 03:31.020
But worrying before I've even done 
anything will get me nowhere.

03:31.980 --> 03:36.270
Brooding won't make me any more capable,

03:36.270 --> 03:39.850
so I've just got to do what I can, 
as well as I can.

03:45.280 --> 03:47.660
So our next campaign is to Aiphos.

03:47.660 --> 03:52.190
I hear we're going to subdue an 
armed band attacking cities.

03:52.190 --> 03:53.870
<i>Royal guardsmen...</i>

03:54.210 --> 03:59.340
They've been infighting on and off 
since before the last king's reign.

03:59.340 --> 04:01.960
Anyway, we'd better keep our wits about us.

04:05.690 --> 04:10.010
<i>Lady Sariphi has arduous duties 
as acting queen consort.</i>

04:10.010 --> 04:13.000
<i>Captain Jormungand has perilous missions.</i>

04:14.190 --> 04:15.480
<i>And I...</i>

04:16.730 --> 04:20.060
<i>What can I do?</i>

04:23.340 --> 04:24.370
<i>I've got it!</i>

04:25.410 --> 04:30.900
<i>Murga, my homeland, has a tradition 
of charms for fortune and protection.</i>

04:31.600 --> 04:33.640
<i>"May you suffer no injury."</i>

04:33.640 --> 04:35.820
<i>"May you never fall ill."</i>

04:35.820 --> 04:37.950
<i>"May your dreams come true."</i>

04:39.060 --> 04:42.580
<i>We imbue each plait with wishes and prayers</i>

04:43.200 --> 04:46.150
<i>to create an amulet of a thousand charms.</i>

04:46.610 --> 04:50.650
<i>This one is for Lady Sariphi, 
who always gives me courage.</i>

04:52.020 --> 04:53.300
<i>And this one...</i>

04:54.630 --> 04:56.160
This is for me?

04:56.160 --> 04:57.640
Y-Yes.

04:58.460 --> 05:00.730
Thank you, Princess Amit.

05:01.110 --> 05:04.480
I had no idea that you 
cared so deeply for me.

05:05.340 --> 05:07.150
Captain Jormungand...

05:07.520 --> 05:08.690
Princess Amit...

05:11.010 --> 05:13.130
Oh, what am I thinking?!

05:21.670 --> 05:23.910
<i>Thank goodness they haven't marched yet.</i>

05:23.910 --> 05:26.000
<i>I must give him my amulet 
before the day is out.</i>

05:26.500 --> 05:28.710
But why, Captain Jormungand, sir?!

05:29.250 --> 05:32.020
Why can't I march with 
you on this campaign?!

05:32.020 --> 05:36.630
Enough! The captain is being considerate. 
He knows your wife is with child.

05:36.630 --> 05:37.780
B-But, sir!

05:38.070 --> 05:41.420
Our duty is to obey the king's commands.

05:41.420 --> 05:46.450
And His Majesty wills that we 
protect his virtuous subjects.

05:47.230 --> 05:50.420
That includes your family.

05:51.390 --> 05:56.760
Your first duty now is to protect 
them in their time of uncertainty.

05:57.240 --> 05:59.870
No one else can see this mission done.

06:02.020 --> 06:05.910
U-Understood! Thank you, sir!

06:07.010 --> 06:09.050
<i>Captain Jormungand...</i>

06:09.050 --> 06:11.650
Won't <i>you</i> ever marry, sir?

06:12.390 --> 06:14.550
What brought this on?

06:14.550 --> 06:16.340
I'd also like to know, sir!

06:19.680 --> 06:20.870
I...

06:24.640 --> 06:29.450
swore to devote my sword, body, 
and soul entirely to His Majesty.

06:29.970 --> 06:31.950
I intend never to wed.

06:34.780 --> 06:35.870
Wow!

06:36.290 --> 06:37.960
A charm for me?

06:37.960 --> 06:39.860
Did you make this, Amit?

06:39.860 --> 06:46.750
This is a Murgan amulet. 
There's a charm on every weave.

06:46.750 --> 06:47.350
Every weave!

06:47.350 --> 06:49.870
I love it. Thank you.

06:48.220 --> 06:49.870
She loves it!

06:49.870 --> 06:50.910
Loves!

06:49.870 --> 06:51.200
It will be my treasure.

06:52.370 --> 06:55.530
And what about that other amulet, Amit?

06:56.910 --> 06:58.480
This is, well...

06:58.480 --> 06:59.980
Is it for Jormungand?

07:02.040 --> 07:02.930
La...

07:02.930 --> 07:04.890
Lady Sariphi!

07:04.890 --> 07:06.450
Wh-What's the matter?

07:07.580 --> 07:13.750
These amulets require praying for the 
recipient through all thousand twists.

07:14.350 --> 07:17.950
Yet I... I...

07:18.630 --> 07:21.820
I couldn't help hoping that 
this amulet would gain me

07:22.780 --> 07:26.630
Captain Jormungand's notice and affection.

07:27.830 --> 07:30.380
I'm ashamed beyond words.

07:30.380 --> 07:33.470
I cannot possibly give him such a gift.

07:35.050 --> 07:39.650
Amit, is wishing for the person 
you love to acknowledge you

07:39.650 --> 07:41.610
really something to be ashamed of?

07:42.340 --> 07:44.410
It doesn't seem that way to me.

07:44.410 --> 07:51.370
But, Lady Sariphi, you would never 
put your own wants first like I have!

07:51.660 --> 07:53.260
That's not true.

07:53.820 --> 08:00.590
All I've done so far is give up 
on everything I <i>want</i> to do.

08:00.590 --> 08:03.200
I haven't achieved anything on my own.

08:05.260 --> 08:11.940
But now I'm so greedy, I wouldn't 
have believed it a little while ago.

08:11.940 --> 08:14.960
Y-You, greedy, Lady Sariphi?

08:14.960 --> 08:15.870
That's right.

08:16.180 --> 08:21.030
I mean, I'm just a human girl, 
but I want to stand beside His Majesty.

08:21.030 --> 08:23.400
What could be greedier than that?

08:23.400 --> 08:27.590
So I think you should be a 
little greedier, too, Amit.

08:29.650 --> 08:35.430
Every one of the thousand wishes you 
put into that charm is genuine, right?

08:38.090 --> 08:39.320
<i>I...</i>

08:40.580 --> 08:42.040
<i>I...</i>

08:43.070 --> 08:44.690
Captain Jormungand!

08:45.470 --> 08:49.780
Is something the matter, Princess Amit? 
You seem quite flustered.

08:51.240 --> 08:52.930
W-Well...

08:53.390 --> 08:54.970
Th-This is for you.

08:55.320 --> 08:57.930
It's a traditional Murgan amulet.

08:58.350 --> 09:00.640
For me?

09:01.760 --> 09:06.650
I imbued it with many charms 
to protect you on your mission.

09:06.650 --> 09:10.790
Please, take this amulet with you.

09:13.840 --> 09:16.290
<i>Oh, please forgive me.</i>

09:16.290 --> 09:21.960
<i>You live for duty, and yet here I am, 
forcing my feelings on you.</i>

09:22.540 --> 09:25.130
<i>But even so, I...</i>

09:27.440 --> 09:29.340
This is serious.

09:30.590 --> 09:36.670
If I fail to complete my mission safely, 
I will injure your reputation.

09:36.670 --> 09:38.890
What?! N-No, um...

09:38.890 --> 09:44.660
I swear to return unscathed, so that I may 
repay you for your thousand prayers.

09:46.630 --> 09:48.020
<i>I...</i>

09:50.120 --> 09:51.030
Thank you!

09:51.910 --> 09:56.900
<i>I truly, truly love that side of you.</i>

10:00.370 --> 10:02.310
Good for you, Amit.

10:02.310 --> 10:05.310
I wish I could be like Captain Jor.

10:05.310 --> 10:06.630
Jor.

10:08.560 --> 10:10.630
<i>I'd better work hard, too.</i>

10:10.630 --> 10:13.200
<i>From now on, every day 
will be like an ordeal.</i>

10:13.690 --> 10:14.830
Sariphi.

10:15.840 --> 10:16.990
Your Majesty.

10:17.430 --> 10:19.920
Your first duty as acting 
queen has been decided.

10:26.090 --> 10:28.350
We will go to the land of Sarbul.

10:30.670 --> 10:35.630
Sarbul is the nearest vassal kingdom 
to the royal capital of Ozmargo.

10:36.030 --> 10:40.120
King Tet VII and his consort, Queen Calra,

10:40.120 --> 10:44.160
have four daughters and one newborn son.

10:45.400 --> 10:51.000
Sariphi, as acting queen consort, 
you will give the prince your blessing.

10:51.670 --> 10:52.960
My blessing?

10:53.230 --> 10:56.010
No special etiquette is required.

10:56.540 --> 11:01.530
Ozmargo has lacked a queen since 
my predecessor's consort passed away.

11:02.040 --> 11:05.480
Priestesses have performed 
the rite in the many years since.

11:05.920 --> 11:10.690
<i>Wouldn't the previous queen 
be the king's mother?</i>

11:11.400 --> 11:14.360
<i>But he sounds so distant 
when he speaks about her.</i>

11:16.380 --> 11:17.190
<i>No.</i>

11:17.670 --> 11:21.140
<i>Right now, I need to focus 
on the job in front of me.</i>

11:22.980 --> 11:24.990
I beseech you, sire!

11:25.320 --> 11:29.020
Please refuse the rite of blessing!

11:29.020 --> 11:31.680
Don't be unreasonable, Calra!

11:31.680 --> 11:34.750
The rite of blessing is 
an Ozmargan tradition.

11:35.700 --> 11:40.080
As a vassal state, we must 
abide by their customs.

11:40.080 --> 11:44.980
But how can we let a <i>human</i> hold Calcara?

11:44.980 --> 11:47.850
He's our precious little prince!

11:48.910 --> 11:50.860
Begging Your Majesty's pardon!

11:51.570 --> 11:56.170
The frontier guards report that the king 
of Ozmargo has crossed our borders.

11:56.170 --> 11:57.020
I see.

11:57.580 --> 12:01.360
I have no more time to waste 
listening to your whims.

12:02.220 --> 12:05.590
Prepare the prince to greet 
the king of Ozmargo!

12:05.590 --> 12:06.810
Sire!

12:12.640 --> 12:13.900
Calcara...

12:14.800 --> 12:18.160
His Majesty thinks only of 
our national reputation.

12:18.160 --> 12:22.140
No one will lend an ear to my concerns.

12:23.250 --> 12:26.090
Oh, my dear little Calcara.

12:26.720 --> 12:31.060
Don't be afraid. I won't let 
any human lay a hand on you.

12:31.720 --> 12:35.740
No matter what, I'll keep you safe.

12:37.730 --> 12:40.320
The king of Ozmargo is here!

12:40.320 --> 12:41.620
Your Majesty!

12:41.620 --> 12:43.420
Long live the King of Ozmargo!

12:43.420 --> 12:44.940
Long may he reign!

12:54.580 --> 12:56.560
<i>The king of Ozmargo...</i>

12:56.560 --> 12:59.260
<i>Our king's nowhere near as intimidating.</i>

12:59.720 --> 13:04.270
Welcome and well met, 
Your Royal Majesty of Ozmargo.

13:04.560 --> 13:07.960
I believe I told you that 
I needed no grand welcome.

13:07.960 --> 13:11.230
Yes. Please forgive me.

13:11.230 --> 13:16.560
This was the very least I could do 
to greet Your Most August Majesty.

13:16.560 --> 13:17.870
And this must be...

13:20.160 --> 13:26.410
<i>So that's the human girl the king 
of Ozmargo wants for his queen.</i>

13:28.100 --> 13:34.790
It's a pleasure to meet Your Majesties, 
King Tet VII and Queen Calra of Sarbul.

13:35.480 --> 13:39.410
I have come as the acting 
queen consort of Ozmargo

13:39.410 --> 13:43.210
to perform the rite of blessing 
on your royal son.

13:44.400 --> 13:46.420
You may call me Sariphi.

13:47.770 --> 13:49.840
My, what a surprise!

13:50.450 --> 13:55.980
I had heard of your human lady, but I never 
dreamed she would be so charming!

13:55.980 --> 13:57.260
Did you, Calra?

13:57.260 --> 13:59.330
No. She is...

13:59.960 --> 14:02.410
truly lovely.

14:05.130 --> 14:10.190
I really ought to have brought 
the prince to greet you as well,

14:10.190 --> 14:14.240
but he has been feeling 
somewhat unwell all morning.

14:14.240 --> 14:15.370
What, Calra?!

14:15.730 --> 14:17.910
Is he all right?

14:18.600 --> 14:21.390
You honor us with your concern.

14:21.390 --> 14:26.140
I promise he will be fit for the royal 
presence before the rite tomorrow.

14:27.430 --> 14:33.110
W-Well, then, I will have a magnificent 
feast prepared for this evening.

14:35.020 --> 14:39.310
Please enjoy the finest 
cuisine Sarbul can offer.

14:39.720 --> 14:44.330
Acting Queen Sariphi, I am told that 
strong drink disagrees with you,

14:44.690 --> 14:48.350
so I have prepared a mild fruit wine.

14:48.350 --> 14:50.800
I hope that it pleases you.

14:51.780 --> 14:55.340
They're treating Sari like a proper guest.

14:55.340 --> 14:59.490
And the queen of Sarbul seems nice. 
I'm so relieved.

14:59.490 --> 15:00.690
Relieved.

15:00.690 --> 15:03.020
Ah! You ate!

15:03.580 --> 15:05.290
It was delicious!

15:10.420 --> 15:14.110
Lady Sariphi, allow the servers to pick it up.

15:14.110 --> 15:16.060
Oh, I'm sorry.

15:17.240 --> 15:18.010
<i>Huh?</i>

15:18.420 --> 15:20.480
<i>Oh, no. I feel kind of...</i>

15:23.080 --> 15:26.840
I-Is anything the matter, 
Your Majesty of Ozmargo?

15:26.840 --> 15:29.440
If anything disagrees with you, then...

15:29.710 --> 15:34.160
I feel somewhat fatigued today. 
I will take my rest early.

15:34.530 --> 15:36.010
Come, Sariphi.

15:36.010 --> 15:37.620
What? Me, too?

15:38.770 --> 15:42.320
Why wouldn't I take my queen 
with me to my chambers?

15:42.650 --> 15:43.860
Now, come along.

15:45.750 --> 15:46.710
<b>FUME</b>

15:50.370 --> 15:55.350
I'm sorry, sire. I spoiled 
that lovely banquet.

15:56.170 --> 15:57.970
I promise I'll do better at the rite tomo—

15:57.970 --> 15:58.900
Sariphi,

15:59.460 --> 16:04.840
aren't you always telling me 
that I need not act tough for you?

16:05.790 --> 16:06.650
Yes.

16:07.070 --> 16:12.990
Then you mustn't put on a brave 
face for me. It wouldn't be fair.

16:17.040 --> 16:18.110
Sire...

16:20.230 --> 16:21.510
You're right.

16:22.840 --> 16:29.100
I'm used to beasts not liking me, 
and I came prepared for it.

16:29.920 --> 16:33.880
But earlier... I could hardly breathe.

16:34.740 --> 16:37.040
The feeling I got from the way 
the queen acted...

16:38.020 --> 16:39.420
I've known it for a long time.

16:40.910 --> 16:44.000
Since the morning after 
I learned I was a sacrifice.

16:44.550 --> 16:47.900
Oh, good morning, Sariphi. You're up early.

16:47.900 --> 16:50.110
Breakfast is ready.

16:50.850 --> 16:52.730
Go wake Maria for me.

16:54.960 --> 16:55.810
Okay.

16:56.280 --> 17:00.060
Right up until the day I 
was offered as a sacrifice,

17:00.060 --> 17:02.590
they acted like nothing had happened.

17:03.390 --> 17:09.830
But it was suffocating, like sinking 
to the bottom of a dark sea.

17:10.620 --> 17:12.930
I didn't feel like I was really alive.

17:14.570 --> 17:16.950
And the queen reminded me of back then.

17:25.020 --> 17:28.270
<b>NUZZLE</b>

17:25.460 --> 17:26.280
Huh?

17:25.980 --> 17:28.270
<b>NUZZLE NUZZLE</b>

17:26.280 --> 17:28.270
Um, s-sire?

17:26.980 --> 17:28.270
<b>NUZZLE NUZZLE</b>

17:28.940 --> 17:34.730
Boor that I am, I cannot find the 
right words for a time like this.

17:34.730 --> 17:38.960
So I'm imitating what you always do for me.

17:48.320 --> 17:49.130
Yah!

17:51.100 --> 17:54.390
Until a moment ago, I was getting cold feet.

17:54.810 --> 17:57.590
I was nervous about the rite tomorrow.

17:58.950 --> 18:02.770
I'm sure that suffocating 
feeling will swallow me again.

18:03.630 --> 18:08.950
I didn't know if I could stand on my 
own two feet and perform the rite.

18:12.420 --> 18:13.570
But...

18:14.310 --> 18:15.620
I'm fine now.

18:17.010 --> 18:18.590
<i>As long as you're with me,</i>

18:19.980 --> 18:24.040
<i>I won't be in that cold, dark sea anymore.</i>

18:25.970 --> 18:31.400
<i>When I'm at your side, I can 
always have warm dreams.</i>

18:33.830 --> 18:35.280
There, there.

18:35.650 --> 18:37.750
Don't fret, Calcara.

18:38.450 --> 18:41.710
I won't let that human touch you.

18:43.240 --> 18:45.630
No matter what,

18:45.630 --> 18:48.150
I'll keep you safe.

18:50.390 --> 18:57.820
Let us now bless His Highness, 
Calcara, first prince of Sarbul.

19:05.170 --> 19:10.800
The Lady Sariphi, acting queen 
consort of Ozmargo,

19:10.800 --> 19:13.640
wishes to bestow her blessing 
on Prince Calcara.

19:16.170 --> 19:18.420
<i>Oh, he's adorable!</i>

19:25.180 --> 19:27.980
<i>I'll pick him up, and then kiss his forehead.</i>

19:31.500 --> 19:35.920
Oh, goodness! What's wrong, Calcara?

19:39.250 --> 19:43.980
My humble apologies. He's usually 
such a well-behaved boy.

19:44.550 --> 19:46.210
There, there, darling.

19:48.700 --> 19:53.270
We cannot continue the holy 
rite while he's acting out.

19:53.270 --> 19:57.340
Loath as I am to ask this, 
might we please postpone it?

19:57.340 --> 20:00.100
Wh-What are you saying, Calra?!

20:00.100 --> 20:04.710
Excuse me. I also think that 
we should wait a little.

20:05.350 --> 20:08.790
I'd feel sorry for the baby, being held 
when he doesn't want to be.

20:09.430 --> 20:11.890
B-But...

20:13.160 --> 20:16.610
Let my queen have her way.

20:16.610 --> 20:22.360
As we will stay through the day, 
we need only attend to other matters first.

20:23.780 --> 20:27.500
Of course! Thank you, sire, 
for your magnanimity.

20:27.880 --> 20:29.590
Let it be so.

20:31.160 --> 20:37.670
<i>I had heard rumors that Queen 
Calra dotes on her only son.</i>

20:38.760 --> 20:41.380
<i>I suspect that she is 
shielding him deliberately.</i>

20:43.610 --> 20:47.100
<i>She plans to avoid completing 
the rite at any cost.</i>

20:47.560 --> 20:51.280
<i>If she succeeds, our acting queen consort's 
first duty will end in infamy.</i>

20:51.890 --> 20:54.970
<i>What will you do, wench?</i>

20:58.340 --> 21:01.920
Your Highness is still feeling 
out of sorts, I see.

21:01.920 --> 21:05.590
Yes. I'm so terribly sorry.

21:05.590 --> 21:06.350
Um...

21:06.730 --> 21:14.070
If you don't mind, I could help soothe him 
while Their Majesties finish talking.

21:17.360 --> 21:19.790
While I appreciate your offer,

21:19.790 --> 21:24.270
I could not be so cavalier with 
the acting queen of Ozmargo.

21:24.270 --> 21:27.300
So thank you very much, but no.

21:28.400 --> 21:29.800
Oh, I see.

21:29.800 --> 21:34.010
You must have nothing to occupy 
you until the talks end.

21:34.290 --> 21:38.380
Please, have a look around 
our palace in the meantime.

21:38.740 --> 21:41.570
I'll summon someone to guide you.

21:41.870 --> 21:43.320
U-Um...

21:43.320 --> 21:44.690
Please wait.

21:46.020 --> 21:51.400
If the acting queen of Ozmargo 
needs a guide, then allow me,

21:53.050 --> 21:54.380
Mother.

23:26.450 --> 23:28.960
Tetra is so precocious and spirited.

23:28.960 --> 23:33.000
And she keeps the demands coming, 
just like Mr. Chancellor.

23:33.000 --> 23:34.250
Ah-choo!

23:34.250 --> 23:38.220
But that's all part of what 
makes her such a cutie-pie!

23:37.020 --> 23:40.010
